  "details": "We're honestly uncertain about how or why or even WHAT this is, but some of my friends can't see one another (including me to my friends) even when in the same server. This also applies to other players we don't know, as my friend told me there were \"five other people\" yet I saw only up to 3 others at any given time.\n\nWhatever is happening, VRChat needs to find out and fix it, as this really breaks up the fun of it. Y'know, NOT BEING ABLE TO PLAY WITH FRIENDS FROM OVER THE WORLD?",
